# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sim-Attrib .gitignore
#
# research/  is the local hyperresearch vault. It holds full text extracted
#            from third-party papers, including paywalled and copyrighted
#            material. It stays LOCAL. It is never committed and never
#            redistributed. Bibliographic facts derived from it belong in
#            audit/LEDGER_CITATIONS.md; the source text itself does not.
#
# .hyperresearch/ is the vault's local configuration and index state. It is
#            machine-specific and contains no project content worth versioning.
#
# .remember/ is a local plugin working directory. It is scratch state
#            belonging to the operator's tooling, not to this project.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

.DS_Store
.remember/
research/
.hyperresearch/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
*.pdf.raw

# Additional local-only working state
research_state/
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
